  "question": {
    "text": "The system shown in the adjacent figure is in equilibrium. The mass of the container with liquid is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math>, the density of the liquid in the container is <math><mi>ρ</mi></math> and volume of the block is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi></math>. If the container is now displaced downwards through a distance <math><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math> and released such that block remains well inside the liquid, during subsequent motion (ignore viscosity)<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/lyhbzfrsipsldkyjfbjvvqpsypdobbqfsetidyqjxnpnzcijng.jpeg\" style=\"height: 224px; width: 150px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "z4eiA",
      "text": "Time period of SHM of the container will be <math><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+2</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "maRH6",
      "text": "Time period of SHM of the container will be <math><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "FBEbZ",
      "text": "The amplitude of SHM of the container will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GUE9u",
      "text": "Container will not perform SHM",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>a</mi></math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/WhatsApp_Image_2020-07-21_at_3.07.43_PM.jpeg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 210px;\" /><br /><br />Where <math><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>K</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br />Or <math><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math> or <math><mi>ω</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><br />The amplitude of SHM will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>",
